                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b8e615a-c9d0-3bd1-840e-bdd9c365d55f",
                        "entry_id": "8b1a16dd-3ed7-3ad4-ae6a-49aaa7e94031",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a surname, Stalin; usually referring to the Russian revolutionary and Soviet Secretary of the Central Committee of the CPSU(b) Joseph Stalin"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f80a60f-ad75-4f3e-94df-c1a7850032cc",
                                "sense_id": "2b8e615a-c9d0-3bd1-840e-bdd9c365d55f",
                                "text": "Чем моло́же бло́гер, тем ху́же он жил при Ста́лине.",
                                "translation": "The younger the blogger, the worse he lived under Stalin.",
                                "english": "The younger the blogger, the worse he lived under Stalin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "870e3e90-9df3-43aa-a45e-1c600e9650b7",
                                "sense_id": "2b8e615a-c9d0-3bd1-840e-bdd9c365d55f",
                                "text": "Когда́ нас в бой пошлёт това́рищ Ста́лин,\nИ пе́рвый ма́ршал в бой нас поведёт!",
                                "translation": "When comrade Stalin will send us to battle,\nThen the first marshal will lead us in combat!",
                                "english": "When comrade Stalin will send us to battle,\nThen the first marshal will lead us in combat!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49001aad-0c54-41fe-b79e-38d2422ef876",
                                "sense_id": "2b8e615a-c9d0-3bd1-840e-bdd9c365d55f",
                                "text": "Артиллери́сты, Ста́лин дал прика́з!\nАртиллери́сты, зовёт Отчи́зна нас!",
                                "translation": "Artillerists, Stalin gave the order!\nArtillerists, the Fatherland calls us!",
                                "english": "Artillerists, Stalin gave the order!\nArtillerists, the Fatherland calls us!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cdedbba-db83-4fc8-aada-2e8e5b4df609",
                                "sense_id": "2b8e615a-c9d0-3bd1-840e-bdd9c365d55f",
                                "text": "Что́бы я́рче заблиста́ли на́ши ло́зунги побе́д,\nЧто́бы ру́ку по́днял Ста́лин, посыла́я нам приве́т.",
                                "translation": "Would that our watchwords of victories flashed brighter,\nWould that Stalin raised his hand, sending us greetings.",
                                "english": "Would that our watchwords of victories flashed brighter,\nWould that Stalin raised his hand, sending us greetings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c29f9de-3ec3-4368-bad1-663d47b79f87",
                                "sense_id": "2b8e615a-c9d0-3bd1-840e-bdd9c365d55f",
                                "text": "Ста́лин де́йствовал не ме́тодами убежде́ния, разъясне́ния и терпели́вого сотру́дничества с людьми́, а путём наси́льственного внедре́ния свои́х иде́й и тре́бования безусло́вного к себе́ подчине́ния. Тот, кто выступа́л про́тив тако́го положе́ния веще́й и́ли же пыта́лся доказа́ть правоту́ свои́х со́бственных взгля́дов, был обречён на удале́ние из числа́ руководя́щих рабо́тников, на после́дующее мора́льное и физи́ческое уничтоже́ние. Тако́е явле́ние произошло́ в пери́од вре́мени, после́довавший вслед за XVII съе́здом па́ртии, когда́ значи́тельное число́ выдаю́щихся парти́йных руководи́телей и рядовы́х активи́стов, явля́вшихся че́стными и и́скренними борца́ми за де́ло коммуни́зма, па́ли же́ртвой деспоти́зма Ста́лина.",
                                "translation": "Stalin acted not through persuasion, explanation and patient cooperation with people, but by imposing his concepts and demanding absolute submission to his opinion. Whoever opposed this concept or tried to prove his viewpoint and the correctness of his position was doomed to removal from the leading collective and to subsequent moral and physical annihilation. This was especially true during the period following the 17th Party Congress, when many prominent party leaders and rank-and-file party workers, honest and dedicated to the cause of Communism, fell victim to Stalin’s despotism.",
                                "english": "Stalin acted not through persuasion, explanation and patient cooperation with people, but by imposing his concepts and demanding absolute submission to his opinion. Whoever opposed this concept or tried to prove his viewpoint and the correctness of his position was doomed to removal from the leading collective and to subsequent moral and physical annihilation. This was especially true during the period following the 17th Party Congress, when many prominent party leaders and rank-and-file party workers, honest and dedicated to the cause of Communism, fell victim to Stalin’s despotism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ae6a128-46fa-4aca-ae83-aa145884950f",
                                "sense_id": "2b8e615a-c9d0-3bd1-840e-bdd9c365d55f",
                                "text": "However, it does not appear that any of the present leaders will rise to the stature of Lenin and Stalin, so that it will be safer to assume that developments in Moscow will be along the lines of what is called collective leadership, unless Western policies force the Soviets to streamline their power organization."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
